  m_text: '01.  Read each message carefully. Look at the tone, the wording and what
    it is asking you to do.


    02.  Check the sender, links and urgency. Look
    for fake addresses, suspicious links and pressure to act fast.


    03.  Mark
    it SCAM or LEGIT and log your reasoning. Explain which clues led to your decision.


    04 
    Expose the scammers. Match patterns across messages, link suspects to their tactics,
    and complete the case file.

'
